/* 

  Number of dice throws until a target is reached  in Picat.

  What is the number of dice throws needed to reach a cumulative
  sum:
   *  larger or equal to a target number.
   *  exactly on target

  We test with some different sum.

  This is a port of my Gamble model gamble_number_of_dice_trows_to_target.rkt

  This program was created by Hakan Kjellerstrand, hakank@gmail.com
  See also my Picat page: http://www.hakank.org/picat/

*/

import ppl_distributions, ppl_utils.

main => go.

